# Package Files #
*.jar
# ...but NOT the Gradle wrapper's own jar. The blanket *.jar above is why it went missing
# from this repo: without the jar, ./gradlew — the command every doc here tells you to run —
# fails on a fresh clone, and regenerating it needs a Gradle you do not have yet.
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# virtual machine crash logs
hs_err_pid*

# Play's upload key and its passwords (T-12): never committed.
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# Untracked service pages (T-28): the Sonos app's undocumented content API, built only with
# -Px2rock.cloudContent for the owner's own TVs. Never committed; see CLAUDE.md.
core/src/cloud/
core/src/cloudTest/

# The developer integration's key and secret, and the speaker salt, live in ~ (T-27, CLAUDE.md);
# should a copy ever land in the tree, it is not picked up by `git add`.
*.api.key
*.api.secret
*.speaker.salt
